                    briefing_title_r2:      `Round 2 — Choose the supply-chain-finance instrument`,
                    briefing_text_r2:       `Design the SCF solution that reconciles liquidity for Maison Velluti with survival for suppliers. <strong>Reverse factoring</strong> lets a bank pay suppliers early at your AA credit rating while you extend your own DPO — it frees cash <em>and</em> helps suppliers (positive-sum). <strong>Dynamic discounting</strong> uses your own cash for discounts — it improves margin but does the opposite of freeing cash. Set the effective DPO, the financing rate (a <strong>sustainability-linked</strong> rate finances the ESG cascade), and the size of the ESG fund. Watch the working-capital model: cash freed and the new effective DPO.`,
