                    rate_tiered:            `Tiered by credit risk only — best rates to the strongest suppliers`,
                    rate_flat:              `One flat rate for everyone, regardless of ESG or tier`,

                    r3_sanfrediano_label:   `Conceria San Frediano — 22% of certified leather, 6 weeks to default. What do you do?`,
                    r3_onboard_label:       `How do you onboard the fragile €200k artisanal workshops to the programme?`,
                    r3_compliance_label:    `How do you drive the new sustainability and traceability codes?`,
                    r3_develop_label:       `Share of fund steered to the critical-but-fragile artisanal tier (%)`,
