                    sf_rescue:              `Rescue and develop it — fast early payment via the SCF programme plus a certification-upgrade plan`,
                    sf_qualify:             `Let it fail but crash-qualify the one other certified tannery as sole source`,
                    sf_exit:                `Treat it as replaceable — exit it, accept single-source concentration on certified leather`,
                    onb_concierge:          `Concierge onboarding — simplified paperwork, field support, the bank platform adapted to micro-suppliers`,
